# RAG split boundary

- `rag-widget/` — WordPress plugin, JS UI, shortcode. HTTP client to backend only.
- `rag-chat-asystent/` — FastAPI, ingest, Chroma, `/chat`. No widget assets here.
- Local dev API URL: `http://127.0.0.1:8000`
- Do not add ingest/Chroma logic to rag-widget.
